        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - The objective needs tight timing, unusual match conditions, coordinated tower control or many victories.\n\n1. Queue for regular Eye of the Storm and ask your team to attempt four-base control. You must personally capture the flag; another teammate's capture does not satisfy your objective.\n\n2. Have teammates take and hold Mage Tower, Draenei Ruins, Fel Reaver Ruins and Blood Elf Tower. Assign defenders before you leave for the middle so an uncontested enemy cannot take a base during your run.\n\n3. Once all FOUR bases show your faction's control, personally pick up the flag at the central platform. Follow an escorted route to the nearest safe friendly tower and enter its flag capture point.\n\n4. Capture while all four bases are still controlled. Do this before your team reaches the resource limit: a match ending while you are carrying the flag does not give you a capture. If a tower is lost, let teammates recover it before completing the planned four-base attempt.\n\n5. Check the achievement after the capture. Comments report inconsistent credit, including captures with fewer bases; those reports do not provide a dependable shortcut. Repeat the stated four-base capture if credit is missing.",
