        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - The objective needs tight timing, unusual match conditions, coordinated tower control or many victories.\n\n1. Track the achievement and queue for regular Eye of the Storm. You need honorable-kill credit for FIVE enemy flag carriers in ONE match. You do not need the killing blows and do not need to pick up or capture the flag yourself.\n\n2. Watch the central flag platform and the battleground map for an enemy pickup. Move to intercept the carrier on the route toward an enemy-controlled tower, bringing damage dealers and a healer if available.\n\n3. Focus the enemy WHILE they are carrying the flag. Slow or stun the carrier, interrupt or control their healers, and stay involved and close enough to receive honorable-kill credit. Killing the player after they have already scored or dropped the flag misses the intended condition.\n\n4. Repeat for five carrier deaths before that match ends. A small coordinated party helps keep pressure on repeated pickups. Defend or contest towers between interceptions so the match does not end before enough enemy flag runs occur.\n\n5. Watch the tracked progress and verify completion in the same match. Do not use old comments' battleground-switching or logout tricks; the intended route is five carrier kills within one uninterrupted battle.",
