        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - The objective needs tight timing, unusual match conditions, coordinated tower control or many victories.\n\n1. Queue for regular Eye of the Storm with a healer or escort if possible. Begin with ZERO deaths and keep that condition from the start of the match until your third personal flag capture. Comments repeatedly confirm that dying before your first capture can invalidate an otherwise clean three-capture streak.\n\n2. Let teammates secure a friendly base and clear the central platform. Personally pick up the flag once the route is safe; use healing, movement and defensive cooldowns to escape pressure without using a flag-dropping ability.\n\n3. Take the flag to a controlled tower and score your FIRST capture. Stay alive, heal up, then return to the middle for the next flag. Another teammate may capture between your runs; your own total still needs to reach three.\n\n4. Repeat the safe pickup and return for your SECOND and THIRD personal captures in that same match. Ask teammates to leave you the next pickup when you are at two, and avoid cliff edges or enemy knockbacks on the bridges.\n\n5. Check the achievement immediately after capture three. If you have died at any earlier point in the match, finish helping your team and start the achievement attempt in a fresh match. Deaths after the achievement has already credited cannot undo it.",
        stepCount = 5,
        waypoints = {
            {
                mapID = 112,
                x = 0.4092,
                y = 0.41850000000000004,
                step = 3,
                label = "Mage Tower (MT)",
