        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Bloodthirsty Berserker",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Play the battleground objectives or complete a personal capture or buffed kill; a few matches may be needed.\n\n1. Queue for regular Eye of the Storm and find the power-up spawn by a tower. Check Mage Tower, Draenei Ruins, Fel Reaver Ruins or Blood Elf Tower; the offered power-up can vary, so a speed or restoration pickup is not the buff you need.\n\n2. Walk through a BERSERKING power-up and confirm that its damage-increasing aura is on YOUR character. A class ability with a similar name is not a substitute. Look for a nearby enemy before spending the short buff duration running across the map.\n\n3. While the aura is still active, personally land the killing blow on an enemy player. Coordinate burst on a low-health target and remain in range; a teammate's killing blow is not the objective as written.\n\n4. Check the achievement. If the buff expires or you die first, find another Berserking pickup and try again. Old reports of rats, totems or other battlegrounds granting credit are inconsistent and are not required for this route.",
