    [613] = {
        achievementId = 613,
        name = "Killed in Quel'Thalas",
        category = "PvP",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Killed in Quel'Thalas",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Defeat an enemy-capital leader, handling guards, defending players and any needed group coordination.\n\n1. Use an ALLIANCE character. At the northern Eastern Plaguelands border (53.8, 8.6), ask Zidormi for Quel'Thalas during The Burning Crusade, then cross into the original Eversong Woods. Midnight's friendly campaign copies of Lor'themar are not the original city-leader target.\n\n2. Travel north through the original Eversong Woods to Silvermoon City's gate around 56, 48. Enter the ORIGINAL city and head through the Court of the Sun toward Sunfury Spire at its northern end. A ground mount works in this older timeline.\n\n3. Find Lor'themar Theron (NPC 16802) inside Sunfury Spire at 54.0, 20.6 on the SILVERMOON CITY map. Bring friends and healing if needed. Prepare for hostile guards, Halduron Brightwing, Grand Magister Rommath and defending Horde players; do not assume an old level-80 health figure describes your current fight.\n\n4. Clear or control the nearby defenders, keep Lor'themar inside the spire so he does not evade, and defeat him while you remain close enough for kill credit. Check the achievement after his death. A quest scene, a friendly modern copy or another blood elf NPC is not a substitute.",
        stepCount = 4,
