        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "The Escape From Durnholde",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Clear the named legacy dungeon or raid and finish its scripted encounters; combat is straightforward at current max level.\n\n1. Normal or Heroic can credit this achievement. Go inside the Caverns of Time in Tanaris and enter OLD HILLSBRAD FOOTHILLS. The achievement calls it The Escape From Durnholde; present-day Hillsbrad's outdoor keep is the wrong destination.\n\n2. Speak to Erozion inside for incendiary bombs and use Brazen's flight to Durnholde. Burn the barrels in all five internment huts, then defeat Lieutenant Drake. Speak to Erozion for any quest hand-in the event requires.\n\n3. Find Thrall in the keep basement and speak to him to start his escape. Stay beside him, kill Captain Skarloc and the ambushes, and speak to him again whenever he stops. At Tarren Mill he waits southwest of the town around 52, 41 on the INSTANCE map; this is not a Tanaris coordinate.\n\n4. Speak to Taretha and Thrall as the story progresses. Defeat the dragon waves and Epoch Hunter when the event spawns him. Running straight to his marked location without completing the escort cannot spawn the boss.",
