        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Clear the named legacy dungeon or raid and finish its scripted encounters; combat is straightforward at current max level.\n\n1. Enter the Battle for Mount Hyjal RAID inside the Caverns of Time, Tanaris. The Cataclysm outdoor Mount Hyjal zone is not this instance.\n\n2. Speak to Jaina Proudmoore at the Alliance camp to start each sequence. Clear the eight waves and Rage Winterchill, then start the next sequence and defeat Anetheron. Speak to Jaina again to move the story onward.\n\n3. At the Horde camp, speak to Thrall to begin the next two wave sequences and defeat Kaz'rogal and Azgalor. Talk to him after the second boss to open the final route.\n\n4. Continue to the World Tree and defeat Archimonde. Keep the Air Burst fall-protection item offered by Tyrande if your character needs it; the achievement is awarded for Archimonde, not merely the camp waves.",
