    [725] = {
        achievementId = 725,
        name = "Thori'dal, the Stars' Fury",
        category = "Collections",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Thori'dal, the Stars' Fury",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Obtain the rare legendary bow from Kil'jaeden; weekly loot opportunities make the wait unpredictable.\n\n1. Use a character who can EQUIP a bow: Hunter, Rogue or Warrior. Looting Thori'dal on a class that cannot wield it does not award this equipment feat.\n\n2. Take Shattrath's portal at 48.9, 42.1 to the original Isle of Quel'Danas. Enter Sunwell Plateau at 44.3, 45.7 and follow the raid route through Brutallus, Felmyst, the Twins and M'uru/Entropius.\n\n3. Kill the three Hand of the Deceiver enemies to release Kil'jaeden, then defeat and loot him. Thori'dal (34334) is a random drop from this final boss, not a quest reward or a drop from Magisters' Terrace.\n\n4. Equip the bow to complete the feat. If it does not drop, return after the weekly raid reset or try another eligible bow-using character. A different class's appearance collection does not replace actually equipping it.",
