        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "The Burning Crusader",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Complete five separate Exalted dungeon-reputation grinds on one character.\n\n1. Use one character for the five required dungeon reputations. Set Dungeon Difficulty to NORMAL for repeatable clears. Wear no reputation-conversion tabard; a later expansion's tabard cannot substitute for these factions.\n\n2. For Honor Hold, repeatedly clear The Shattered Halls in Hellfire Citadel (47.7, 52.0). Its Normal kills continue beyond the lower-level dungeons' caps. Exit, reset outside and repeat; no Flamewrought Key is needed.\n\n3. For Cenarion Expedition, dive through Coilfang Reservoir's central pipe in Zangarmarsh (50.4, 40.9) and clear Normal Steamvault. Activate the panels after Thespia and Steamrigger to open Kalithresh's room. Finish with a Heroic Coilfang run if Normal kills stop at the final point before Exalted.\n\n4. For Lower City, clear Normal Shadow Labyrinth at the SOUTH side of Auchindoun (39.6, 73.6). Mana-Tombs awards Consortium reputation instead; do not farm it for Lower City. Shadow Labyrinth needs no entry key in Retail.\n\n5. For The Sha'tar, fly to Tempest Keep in Netherstorm and repeatedly clear Normal Botanica (71.7, 55.0), Mechanar (70.6, 69.8) or Arcatraz (74.4, 57.7). The Eye raid does not replace these dungeon farms.\n\n6. For Keepers of Time, enter Old Hillsbrad (26.8, 36.8) or Black Morass (37.2, 83.3) on the Caverns of Time map. Complete the Thrall escort or Medivh's 18-rift event. Both Normal dungeons remain repeatable; there is no need to buy an old key or deliberately fail an event.\n\n7. Repeat the appropriate routes until all five factions are Exalted on this character. Respect the hourly instance-entry limit and daily Heroic boss lockouts. Reputation bonuses change the number of runs, so check the actual reputation bars instead of relying on fixed completion times.",
