    [783] = {
        achievementId = 783,
        name = "The Perfect Storm",
        category = "PvP",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "The Perfect Storm",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - The objective needs tight timing, unusual match conditions, coordinated tower control or many victories.\n\n1. Queue for regular Eye of the Storm and agree on a tower rush before the gates open. The intended result is a 1,500-to-0 victory: even one enemy resource tick can spoil it. A party with healers and good communication helps, but no obsolete fifteen-player queue addon is needed.\n\n2. Send strong groups to the enemy-side towers immediately, while a small number of allies secure your nearer towers. Keep the enemy's towers NEUTRAL until your side captures them; retaking a tower after the enemy already earned resources is too late for the clean attempt.\n\n3. Hold all four towers, leave defenders at each, and call incoming attackers. Keep fighting inside capture areas and rotate help quickly. Do not abandon every base to fight at a graveyard or in the middle.\n\n4. After tower control is secure, escort the central flag to a friendly base to finish faster. Keep the enemy score at zero through the victory and check the achievement at the result screen.\n\n5. If the enemy gains points, finish the match for your team's win and try again later. Comments report some unintended credit in other modes and older patches; a normal four-base shutout remains the route that satisfies the stated objective.",
        stepCount = 5,
        waypoints = {
            {
