        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - The objective needs tight timing, unusual match conditions, coordinated tower control or many victories.\n\n1. Track the ten-win counter and queue for regular Eye of the Storm. The stated objective is ten VICTORIES where your team holds all four bases when the match ends; temporarily taking four bases earlier is not the planned completion condition.\n\n2. Secure your nearer towers, then rotate a coordinated group with healing support to the enemy towers. Leave defenders at Mage Tower, Draenei Ruins, Fel Reaver Ruins and Blood Elf Tower as each is captured.\n\n3. When all four show your faction's control, keep defenders in place and run the central flag to speed up the final resources. Check the map before the last score: a stealth player can neutralize a tower while everyone else is celebrating.\n\n4. Stay through the victory and check the achievement's counter. Repeat on later matches until ten wins have credited; the victories need not be consecutive or within one play session.\n\n5. Retail commenters through late 2025 report missed four-base credit and unexpected credit with fewer bases. A reply for 12.0.1 reports that credit arrived on the NEXT win. If a clean victory appears missing, check again after your next completed win. This is a player-reported workaround, not a guaranteed trigger; standing on a particular base or dying at the end has not been a consistent solution.",
