        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Visit the required discovery points; use the original timeline for the old Quel'Thalas zones.\n\n1. Track the achievement and visit each unchecked subzone below. These are exploration trigger areas, not instance entrances; wait for the named criterion to credit, and move a little closer to the ground or within the area if needed.\n\n2. Explore Gyro-Plank Bridge (22.0, 56.0); Ruins of Enkaat (32.0, 56.0); Area 52 (33.0, 65.0). Skip any location already credited in your achievement.\n\n3. Explore Manaforge B'naar (22.0, 70.0); The Heap (31.0, 76.0); Arklon Ruins (40.0, 75.0). Skip any location already credited in your achievement.\n\n4. Explore Manaforge Coruu (48.0, 84.0); Kirin'Var Village (56.0, 85.0); Sunfury Hold (56.0, 78.0). Skip any location already credited in your achievement.\n\n5. Explore Manaforge Duro (59.0, 67.0); Tempest Keep - outdoor exploration area (71.0, 65.0); Celestial Ridge (72.0, 40.0). Skip any location already credited in your achievement.\n\n6. Explore Manaforge Ultris (62.0, 39.0); Ethereum Staging Grounds (55.0, 42.0); Eco-Dome Midrealm (45.0, 54.0). Skip any location already credited in your achievement.\n\n7. Explore The Stormspire (44.0, 36.0); Manaforge Ara (26.0, 38.0); Socrethar's Seat (29.0, 15.0). Skip any location already credited in your achievement.\n\n8. Explore Forge Base: Oblivion (37.0, 25.0); Eco-Dome Farfield (45.0, 13.0); Netherstone (49.0, 18.0). Skip any location already credited in your achievement.\n\n9. Explore Ruins of Farahlon (54.0, 25.0). Skip any location already credited in your achievement.\n\n10. Check the achievement's remaining names before leaving. Exploration is credited by entering the correct outdoor area, not by killing its inhabitants or entering a similarly named dungeon. Hostile towns may flag the opposing faction for PvP; approach only far enough to receive exploration credit.",
