        itemId = 35513,
        name = "Swift White Hawkstrider",
        stepCount = 7,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - A rare boss drop and daily or weekly loot lockouts make the number of attempts unpredictable.\n\n1. Go to Shattrath City and take the portal at 48.6, 42.0 to the ORIGINAL Isle of Quel'Danas. Retail comments after Midnight confirm that this portal still reaches the Burning Crusade island. This route avoids confusing the new Midnight island and dungeon with the old ones.\n\n2. Set Dungeon Difficulty to HEROIC before entering original Magisters' Terrace at 61.2, 30.9 on Isle of Quel'Danas (#122). Confirm the instance is Heroic. Normal mode is not the direct Swift White Hawkstrider farming route.\n\n3. Follow the entrance path to Selin Fireheart at 42.4, 22.3 on Observation Grounds. Defeat him and clear any nearby enemies pulled into combat so you can continue through the opened route.\n\n4. Continue through the mana-wyrm hall to Vexallus at 83.4, 26.4 on Observation Grounds. Defeat Vexallus and proceed through the courtyard toward the next boss; kill summoned Pure Energy if the fight lasts long enough for it to appear.\n\n5. On Grand Magister's Asylum, defeat Priestess Delrissa and all four companions at 39.7, 55.7. Do not leave a surviving companion behind: finish the entire encounter to open the route to the final chamber.\n\n6. Reach Kael'thas at 8.6, 50.2 on Grand Magister's Asylum and defeat him. If the encounter reaches Gravity Lapse, move away from the floating orbs and finish him when you can attack again. Loot Kael'thas himself for a chance at Swift White Hawkstrider.\n\n7. Use the mount item if it drops. After looting, use the orb behind Kael'thas to leave. If it did not drop, repeat after the daily Heroic reset or on another eligible character; Reset All Instances does not refresh this character's Heroic loot.",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=884",
