        cost = "No purchase cost for the raid-drop route.",
        tips = "The existing weekly farming advice is retained, but a full raid clear is optional. There is no required number of attempts, special looting order, or need to kill the phoenix boss first. This Kael'thas is different from the dungeon boss in Magisters' Terrace. Obtain and learn the mount on this account. The feat may trigger when the reins are looted; its Feat of Strength category does not mean this mount has been removed.",
