            },
            { mapID = 102, x = 0.792, y = 0.638, step = 6, label = "Fedryen Swiftspear - buy the hippogryph at Exalted" },
        },
        itemId = 33999,
        name = "Cenarion War Hippogryph",
        stepCount = 6,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Reach Cenarion Expedition Exalted through repeatable dungeon farming and pay the mount's gold cost.\n\n1. Check your character's Cenarion Expedition reputation. The mount requires Exalted with the Outland faction, not the Cenarion Circle. If already Exalted, go straight to Fedryen Swiftspear in step 6.\n\n2. Travel to Coilfang Reservoir in Zangarmarsh at 50.4, 40.8. Swim down the central underwater pipe and continue until you emerge in the air-filled entrance cavern. Set Dungeon Difficulty to Normal for repeatable farming.\n\n3. Enter The Steamvault from the rear of the cavern; verify the instance name rather than entering The Slave Pens, The Underbog or Serpentshrine Cavern. Clear the naga and other reputation-awarding trash as well as the bosses. Normal Steamvault continues awarding Cenarion Expedition reputation through Revered.\n\n4. For a full clear, defeat Hydromancer Thespia at 54.2, 13.7 and Mekgineer Steamrigger at 34.1, 81.9 on The Steamvault floor. Activate the access panels associated with their areas to open the final boss route. Defeat Warlord Kalithresh at 75.9, 43.6 and kill remaining useful trash before leaving. Remove any city reputation tabard if kills are crediting a different faction.\n\n5. Exit, reset the Normal instance outside and repeat until Cenarion Expedition is Exalted. Pause at the hourly instance limit. If Normal kills leave you at the final point before Exalted, complete a Heroic Coilfang dungeon for the remaining reputation. Existing Cenarion Expedition quests in Outland are optional extra reputation; the old Coilfang Armaments turn-ins are no longer a current shortcut.\n\n6. Visit Fedryen Swiftspear at Cenarion Refuge, 79.2, 63.8 in Zangarmarsh. Buy Cenarion War Hippogryph for its usual Exalted price of 1,600 gold (2,000 gold base), then use the item from your bags.",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=893",
