        name = "Flying High Over Skettis",
        category = "Reputation",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Flying High Over Skettis",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Repeat quests, dungeon clears or item turn-ins until the required faction reaches Exalted.\n\n1. Take Threat from Above from Yuula beside Shattrath's flight master (64, 42). Kill 20 Gordunni ogres in the Barrier Hills north of Shattrath, return, and follow To Skettis to Adaris at Blackwind Landing (64, 66.8 in Terokkar).\n\n2. Complete Severin's World of Shadows: collect 6 Shadow Dust from Skettis arakkoa and exchange it for Elixir of Shadows. Keep that buff active to see time-lost arakkoa and collect their Time-Lost Scrolls.\n\n3. Kill Talonpriest Ishaal (69.3, 78.5), start his dropped Almanac quest, and take it to Adaris. For An Ally in Lower City, visit Rilak in Shattrath (52.6, 20.8); return to Adaris with Countdown to Doom.\n\n4. At Hazzik, retrieve Hazzik's Package from the ground-level hut in UPPER Veil Shil'ak (74.8, 80.2). Use A Shabby Disguise to buy Adversarial Bloodlines from Sahaak (67, 79), then return to Hazzik.\n\n5. Gather 40 Time-Lost Scrolls. At small Skull Piles summon four DIFFERENT descendants, spending 10 scrolls each: Akkarai, Karrog, Gezzarak and Vakkiz. Keep one of each token and exchange the set with Hazzik for a Time-Lost Offering.\n\n6. Take Terokk's Downfall from Adaris. Use the Offering at the LARGE island Skull Pile on Terokk's Rest (66.2, 77.5), kill Terokk and turn in. If he shields, bring him into the Skyguard's blue fire.\n\n7. Repeat arakkoa/treant kills, dust exchanges, descendant-token sets and Terokk summons until Sha'tari Skyguard is Exalted. Keep the elixir refreshed. Bombing and escort dailies add reputation, but are not the only source; the achievement does not require buying a nether ray.",
