        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Repeat quests, dungeon clears or item turn-ins until the required faction reaches Exalted.\n\n1. Take Shattrath's portal (48.9, 42.1) to the ORIGINAL Isle of Quel'Danas. This reputation route uses the old island and original Magisters' Terrace, not Midnight's replacement content.\n\n2. Set Dungeon Difficulty to NORMAL and clear original Magisters' Terrace (61.2, 30.9), killing all reputation-awarding trash and the four bosses. Exit using the orb after Kael'thas, reset outside and repeat. Normal runs are repeatable and can finish the reputation.\n\n3. For variety, take Shattered Sun daily quests around Sun's Reach Harbor: the bloodberry collection, Dawnblade kills, Greengill murloc rescue and ley-line survey can be combined on one circuit. Complete their listed objectives before returning to the harbor.\n\n4. Continue dungeon clears and available dailies to Shattered Sun Offensive Exalted. A daily Heroic Terrace clear also offers the mount chance. The achievement itself does not grant the title: A Magnanimous Benefactor, offered at Exalted, is a separate optional 1,000-gold donation.",
