    [898] = {
        achievementId = 898,
        name = "On Wings of Nether",
        category = "Reputation",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "On Wings of Nether",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Repeat quests, dungeon clears or item turn-ins until the required faction reaches Exalted.\n\n1. Find Mordenai walking in Netherwing Fields (60, 59) in OUTLAND Shadowmoon Valley. Complete Kindness by feeding eight mature drakes with carcasses obtained from Rocknail Flayers. Enable Trivial Quests so the old chain remains visible.\n\n2. Find Neltharaku flying HIGH above the fields. Finish his dialogue, kill the requested Dragonmaw orcs, collect 12 Nethervine Crystals on Netherwing Ledge, then use his enchanted crystal to release enslaved drakes at Dragonmaw Fortress. Help the freed drakes fight instead of killing them.\n\n3. At the fortress platform (69.8, 61.5), accept Karynaku's Zuluhed the Whacked. Kill Zuluhed, loot the key, free Karynaku and finish Ally of the Netherwing with Mordenai. Continue Blood Oath of the Netherwing and In Service of the Illidari to the disguised base camp on the southern island.\n\n4. Speak to Mor'ghor and Taskmaster Varkule Dragonbreath at the base camp (66, 86). Complete Yarzill's Your Friend on the Inside and The Great Netherwing Egg Hunt; later eggs use Accepting All Eggs. Eggs can be handed in repeatedly on the same day.\n\n5. Search the ledge, floating rocks, fortress and Netherwing Mines (65.3, 90) for ground eggs. Loot mine flayers and ravagers for random eggs as well; Murkblood Miners do not drop loot. Combine this with the camp/mine dailies for crystals, cargo and enemy kills as they unlock.\n\n6. Return for each reputation-rank promotion and keep doing eggs and dailies until Netherwing is Exalted. Applicable Timewalking or other reputation buffs help; no fixed egg count works for every starting rank and bonus. Exalted completes this achievement; the later Illidan rescue and free-drake selection are optional mount rewards.",
