        name = "The Czar of Sporeggar",
        category = "Reputation",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "The Czar of Sporeggar",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Repeat quests, dungeon clears or item turn-ins until the required faction reaches Exalted.\n\n1. Set Dungeon Difficulty to NORMAL and travel to Coilfang Reservoir in Serpent Lake, Zangarmarsh (50.4, 40.9). Dive through the central pipe and surface in the entrance cavern.\n\n2. Enter The Underbog on the right (54.2, 34.5 on the Zangarmarsh map). Speak to T'shu just INSIDE and take Bring Me A Shrubbery! (29691). This current dungeon version does not require the old outdoor Sporeggar introduction.\n\n3. Pick Sanguine Hibiscus from the glowing red dungeon plants and loot it from bog creatures, bats and bosses. Herbalism is not required. Clear the opening bog section and check the path toward the naga bridge.\n\n4. Return to T'shu and hand in 5 flowers. Continue with Bring Me Another Shrubbery! (29692), 5 flowers for 750 base reputation per completion. Keep the items in your bags for the hand-in.\n\n5. Repeat until Sporeggar is Exalted. Leave and reset the Normal dungeon when more flowers are needed, or buy tradable Sanguine Hibiscus. At exactly Neutral, with no reputation bonuses or kill reputation, 280 flowers cover 42,000 reputation; check your standing before buying. Glowcaps are optional vendor currency, not the flowers needed for this grind.",
        stepCount = 5,
        waypoints = {
