        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Mag'har of Draenor",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Repeat quests, dungeon clears or item turn-ins until the required faction reaches Exalted.\n\n1. Use an Horde character for The Mag'har and travel to Nagrand in OUTLAND. This is the old reputation, not Draenor's factions or the Mag'har allied race.\n\n2. Kill ogres in Laughing Skull Ruins (46, 23), Warmaul Hill (29, 26), or the Boulderfist caves around 49, 56 and 40, 32. Loot all Obsidian Warbeads. Eligible ogre kills themselves grant reputation, including the early standing needed to speak to the faction.\n\n3. Once the faction will speak to you, visit Warden Bullrok in Garadar (55.8, 37.8). Complete Fierce Enemies with 10 Obsidian Warbeads, then use More Warbeads! for further stacks of 10. These turn-ins are repeatable, not daily.\n\n4. Continue kills and hand-ins until Exalted. Nagrand's faction quests are useful extra reputation. Give your beads to your faction's warden rather than the Consortium if this achievement is your immediate goal; the same stack cannot credit both.\n\n5. The achievement completes at Exalted; buying a mount is optional. The faction's eight regular talbuks then become available from Provisioner Nasela in Garadar (53.5, 36.9).",
