    [906] = {
        achievementId = 906,
        name = "Kickin' It Up a Notch",
        category = "Quests",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Kickin' It Up a Notch",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete each required daily quest when it is offered; the rotation prevents finishing all objectives on demand.\n\n1. Learn Outland Cooking and visit The Rokk in northern Lower City, Shattrath (61.6, 15.8). He offers one of four cooking dailies each day. Return on later days until you have personally completed all four different quests; they are not a guaranteed four-day rotation.\n\n2. For Super Hot Stew, bring 2 Mok'Nathal Shortribs and 1 Crunchy Serpent. Learn those recipes from the Blade's Edge cooking suppliers or the Mok'Nathal Treats quest at Mok'Nathal Village (76.0, 60.3). Kill an Abyssal Flamebringer in Forge Camp: Terror and use the supplied cooking pot beside its remains to make the quest stew.\n\n3. For Soup for the Soul, prepare 4 Roasted Clefthoof. Go to the Ancestral Grounds in southwest Outland Nagrand (around 25, 61) and use the quest's pot there. Carrying the food without cooking the quest soup at the required place is insufficient.\n\n4. For Revenge is Tasty, bring 3 Warp Burgers and kill Monstrous Kaliri in Skettis for a Giant Kaliri Wing. Use the quest pot to make Kaliri Stew, then return to The Rokk.\n\n5. For Manalicious, collect 15 Mana Berries from the bushes inside Netherstorm's eco-domes, such as Eco-Dome Midrealm (46, 55). Return them to The Rokk.\n\n6. Turn in each completed daily and check that its name credits. Keep the reward bags for rare Outland cooking recipes, including those needed by Outland Gourmet. An already completed daily can repeat for many days while you wait for the missing one.",
        stepCount = 6,
        waypoints = {
            { mapID = 111, x = 0.616, y = 0.158, step = 1, label = "The Rokk - check today's cooking quest" },
            { mapID = 105, x = 0.76, y = 0.603, step = 2, label = "Mok'Nathal Treats - two needed cooking recipes" },
            { mapID = 105, x = 0.29, y = 0.8, step = 2, label = "Forge Camp: Terror - Abyssal Flamebringer cooking area" },
            { mapID = 107, x = 0.25, y = 0.61, step = 3, label = "Ancestral Grounds - cook Soup for the Soul" },
