        name = "Hills Like White Elekk",
        category = "Quests",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Hills Like White Elekk",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete all three Nagrand hunting chains and their named-target finale.\n\n1. Go to Nesingwary Safari (71.5, 40.7) in Nagrand, OUTLAND. Enable Trivial Quests. Accept all three opening Mastery quests from Hemet Nesingwary, Harold Lane and Shado 'Fitz' Farstrider; the three hunting chains can progress together.\n\n2. For Clefthoof Mastery, kill 12 ordinary Clefthoofs, return to Hemet, then kill 12 Clefthoof Bulls and return again. His third quest asks for Banthar's Horn. Search Banthar's patrol in the western/central grasslands, around 37, 61 to 42, 60; kill and LOOT her before returning.\n\n3. For Talbuk Mastery, kill 12 Talbuk Stags, turn in, then kill 12 Talbuk Thorngrazers and turn in. The third quest needs Bach'lor's Hoof. Search for the named talbuk traveling with a herd in western Nagrand, around 29, 34; loot him and report to Harold.\n\n4. For Windroc Mastery, kill 12 Windrocs, return, then 12 Ravenous Windrocs and return. The third quest needs Gutripper's Eye. Look UP along the western foothills around 33, 30: Gutripper flies a patrol instead of standing at the map point. Kill and loot her, then return to Shado.\n\n5. After turning in all three named hunts, accept The Ultimate Bloodsport from Hemet. Kill Tusker on the raised ground northeast of Oshu'gun (44.4, 65.9), loot Tusker's Heart and return to Hemet. This final quest completes the achievement; killing the animals before accepting their particular quest does not substitute for the chain.",
