        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Master of Eye of the Storm",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - The objective needs tight timing, unusual match conditions, coordinated tower control or many victories.\n\n1. Open this meta and track its actual unchecked child achievements. Queue for regular Eye of the Storm so the four-base routes in those guides match the battleground you enter. Storm Glory is a separate achievement and is not a required child of this meta.\n\n2. Build the cumulative wins toward Eye of the Storm Veteran, planning four-base victories for Eye of the Storm Domination. Keep defenders at the four tower pins and use each child's counter to identify what remains.\n\n3. In matches with safe middle control, personally capture a flag for Storm Capper, then attempt Bound for Glory with three captures and no deaths BEFORE the third capture. Arrange an escort and ask teammates to leave you the necessary pickups.\n\n4. In other matches, intercept five enemy carriers for Stormtrooper and rotate tower fights for Stormy Assassin. Find a Berserking power-up for Bloodthirsty Berserker and kill an opposing buffed player for Take a Chill Pill.\n\n5. Use coordinated tower rushes for The Perfect Storm's shutout and Flurry's under-six-minute win. Finish every child shown by the meta. Open an incomplete child's detailed guide rather than assuming a victory automatically satisfies its personal actions or location counters.",
