    [1189] = {
        achievementId = 1189,
        name = "To Hellfire and Back",
        category = "Quests",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "To Hellfire and Back",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Finish the named zone's story chapters and their quest prerequisites; legacy combat alone does not complete them.\n\n1. On an ALLIANCE character, enable Trivial Quests and track the eight chapter criteria. Begin at Honor Hold with Danath and the introductory Legion quests. Retail uses chapter completions, so old advice to reach a fixed quest count, obtain a Shattered Halls key or grind PvP repeatables is obsolete.\n\n2. For Disrupt the Burning Legion, follow The Legion Reborn -> The Path of Anguish -> Expedition Point -> Disrupt Their Reinforcements. Complete the gateway bombing mission, report to Shatter Point, and continue the Abyssal Shelf / forge-camp chain through Invasion Point: Annihilator. Use the mission flight NPC and supplied bombs when the quest asks for a bombing run.\n\n3. For Overthrow the Overlord, loot the Burning Legion Missive from the northern demons, start The Dark Missive and finish The Heart of Darkness / Overlord with Honor Hold. Kill Arazzius the Cruel at the Pools of Aggonar and return; a kill before accepting the quest will not finish the chapter.\n\n4. Follow Expedition Point's fel-orc chain through Fel Orc Scavengers, Ill Omens, Cursed Talismans and Warlord of the Bleeding Hollow. Return to Honor Hold. Digging for Prayer Beads and Fel Spirits lead to The Exorcism of Colonel Jules: speak to Anchorite Barada upstairs in the inn and protect the ritual. Continue Trollbane is Looking for You -> Drill the Drillmaster, kill Drillmaster Zurok and turn in. These are two separate chapters.\n\n5. At Temple of Telhamat, complete Obadei/Makuru's In Search of Sedai -> Return to Obadei -> Makuru's Vengeance -> Atonement, and follow the relic investigation through The Seer's Relic at Sedai's body. For the Temple chapter, also finish its Pools of Aggonar cleansing and local arakkoa/ravager chains, following The Longbeards to the southern camp when offered.\n\n6. For Green, But Not Orcs, do BOTH goblin groups. Foreman Razelcraz outside the mine northwest of Thrallmar offers Outland Sucks! -> How to Serve Goblins -> Shizz Work -> Beneath Thrallmar. At Zeppelin Crash, finish Screed's In Case of Emergency... / Voidwalkers Gone Wild and Legassi's Ravager Egg Roundup -> Hellboar, the Other White Meat -> Smooth as Butter.\n\n7. At Cenarion Post in western Hellfire, finish Demonic Contamination -> Testing the Antidote. Complete Colossal Menace, loot the giants' Crimson Crystal Shard and follow The Earthbinder -> Natural Remedies, using the supplied quest item at the marked green rune and finishing the resulting event. Turn in and check all eight named chapters.",
