    [1190] = {
        achievementId = 1190,
        name = "Mysteries of the Marsh",
        category = "Quests",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Mysteries of the Marsh",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Finish the named zone's story chapters and their quest prerequisites; legacy combat alone does not complete them.\n\n1. Enable Trivial Quests and track your FACTION's chapter list. Both factions complete the Cenarion Refuge, Leesa'oh and Sporeggar stories; Alliance additionally uses Telredor/Orebor, while Horde uses Swamprat Post/Zabra'jin. Current progress follows named stories rather than an old 52/54-quest counter.\n\n2. At Ysiel Windbringer in Cenarion Refuge (78.4, 62), complete Disturbance at Umbrafen Lake -> As the Crow Flies -> Balance Must Be Preserved. Loot the Drain Schematics from naga, bring them back and continue Warning the Cenarion Circle to Cenarion Post in Hellfire (16, 52.2). Return to Ysiel with Return to the Marsh to finish Draining the Marsh.\n\n3. For Saving the Sporeloks, finish the Refuge's Umbrafen Tribe, A Damp, Dark Place, Saving the Sporeloks and Safeguarding the Watchers quests. Lauranna, Windcaller Blackhoof and Lethyn are close together around 80, 64. Enter Funggor Cavern for its actual cave objectives and return for every follow-up.\n\n4. For Don't Eat THOSE Mushrooms!, find Watcher Leesa'oh at Cenarion Watchpost (23.3, 66.2). Follow A Question of Gluttony -> Familiar Fungi -> Stealing Back the Mushrooms. These quests are away from the main Refuge and are easy to miss when following only the road hubs.\n\n5. For A Trip With the Sporelings, start Fahssn's Spawning Glen introductions (19, 63), then follow the invitation to Sporeggar. Raise Sporeggar to Friendly if necessary and complete Now That We're Friends... against the naga. Also complete Fhwoor Smash!'s escort when offered; Fhwoor can be absent while another player's escort is active, so wait for him to return rather than repeatedly grinding an unrelated reputation quest.\n\n6. ALLIANCE: At Telredor, finish its quests through An Unnatural Drought. Follow the Feralfen investigation through Messenger to the Feralfen for Draenei Diplomacy; use the quest disguise/potion as instructed instead of attacking the friendly quest objective. At Orebor Harborage, finish the Broken's bog-giant/naga and Marshlight Lake chain through The Terror of Marshlight Lake.\n\n7. HORDE: At Swamprat Post, finish the Dead Mire investigation through Jyoba's Report. At Zabra'jin, follow the wildlife hunt through Pursuing Terrorclaw. Finish the defenses against Ango'rosh and Daggerfen through Message to the Daggerfen. Return for the final hand-ins, then check the seven chapters applicable to your faction.",
