    [1191] = {
        achievementId = 1191,
        name = "Terror of Terokkar",
        category = "Quests",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Terror of Terokkar",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Finish the named zone's story chapters and their quest prerequisites; legacy combat alone does not complete them.\n\n1. Enable Trivial Quests and track the five chapter criteria. Start at Allerian Stronghold. Complete its arakkoa investigations, wolf/seed errands and Torgos hunt; for Torgos, kill Trachela at Carrion Hill, loot the carcass and use it at Torgos's Scarecrow in Veil Rhaze. Follow Jenai Starwhisper, Ros'eleth, Bertelm and the other Allerian quest givers through their final hand-ins.\n\n2. For The Warden's Secret, start Earthbinder Tavgren's investigation at Cenarion Thicket (44, 26). Finish Strange Energy, Clues in the Thicket and Watching You!, then stop Empoor on the road for By Any Means Necessary.... Follow Wind Trader Lathrai's favors in Shattrath and the Tuurem investigation back to Tavgren. The story crosses maps rather than ending with one local kill quest.\n\n3. Continue the Firewing investigation via your faction's camp east of its stronghold. Kill Sharth Voldoun on Firewing Point's upper platform, using the translocation orb inside the tower to reach him. Loot the Final Code, activate the mana bomb and finish Letting Earthbinder Tavgren Know. This final report is a commonly missed part of the Warden chapter.\n\n4. For The Skettis Offensive, start Kirrik's arakkoa chain at Refugee Caravan (37.3, 51). Visit Rilak the Redeemed in Shattrath's Lower City, gather the Eyes of Skettis at Veil Reskk/Shienor, then work through Kirrik's Veil Skith -> Rhaze -> Lithic -> Shalas follow-ups. Return to Shattrath and complete Defender Grashna's Skettis Offensive event. Sha'tari Skyguard Exalted is not required.\n\n5. For Refugee Caravan, complete Mekeda's Before Darkness Falls, loot Cabal Orders and follow The Shadow Tomb. Finish Ethan's Missing Friends, Lakotae's Infested Protectors, Orglum's Tomb of Lights / Vengeful Souls and Soolaveen's Recover the Bones. Follow Ramdor's Helping the Lost Find Their Way when offered; the caravan's different NPC chains all matter.\n\n6. For Sha'tari Base Camp, visit Letoll near 31.3, 76.2. Stay with the Digging for Bones event, then finish Dwarfowitz's Fumping -> The Big Bone Worm. Complete Ra'vaj's Improper Burial -> A Hero Is Needed -> The Fallen Exarch. Also finish Vindicator Haylen's For the Fallen -> Terokkarantula -> Return to Sha'tari Base Camp; Haylen stands east of Auchindoun and is easy to overlook.\n\n7. Turn in the final reports to your stronghold, Tavgren, Rilak/Grashna, Refugee Caravan and Sha'tari Base Camp as appropriate. Check the five named chapters instead of following old advice to reach a numeric quest total. A quest completed but still waiting for its final report may leave its chapter unfinished.",
