    [1193] = {
        achievementId = 1193,
        name = "On the Blade's Edge",
        category = "Quests",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "On the Blade's Edge",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Finish the named zone's story chapters and their quest prerequisites; legacy combat alone does not complete them.\n\n1. Enable Trivial Quests and track the FOUR chapters for your faction. Alliance needs Sylvanaar, Toshley's Station, The Gronn Threat and Ruuan Weald. Horde needs Thunderlord Stronghold, The Mok'Nathal, Reunion and Ruuan Weald. The old Ogri'la/Apexis-relic chapter is removed; neither its reputation grind nor its daily unlock is required.\n\n2. ALLIANCE - Sylvanaar: start Commander Skyshadow's Bloodmaul/Bladespire ogre chains. Rescue Vindicator Vuuleen in the Bladespire cage, recover The Trappings of a Vindicator from Droggam and Mugdorg, kill Gorr'Dim, then complete Planting the Banner in Northmaul Tower. Follow Where Did Those Darn Gnomes Go? to the gnome wreck rather than stopping at the banner.\n\n3. ALLIANCE - Toshley's Station: follow the R-3D0 / gnome introductions to Toshley's Station (60.5, 69). Complete the power-converter, lightning, trapping and Show Them Gnome Mercy! chains. Finish the Test Flight quests, INCLUDING Test Flight: Ruuan Weald and its arrival hand-in; merely flying to Evergrove yourself does not finish the test-flight chain.\n\n4. HORDE - Thunderlord Stronghold: complete Gor'drek's wildlife chains and Tor'chunk's Bladespire Threat. Loot Thunderlord Clan Artifacts from the ogres and follow Rokgah's Vision Guide to The Thunderspike, inside the southern cave. Also finish T'chali's Bloodmaul Ravine chain: recover his hookah/brews, use the keg on the quest targets, kill Grimnok/Korgaah and finish A Curse Upon Both of Your Clans!.\n\n5. HORDE - The Mok'Nathal: at Mok'Nathal Village (76, 60), finish Dertrok's Vekhnir stone chain through Trial and Error. Follow Leoroxx's Understanding the Mok'Nathal -> Since Time Forgotten... -> Slay the Brood Mother -> Totems of My Enemy -> Spirit Calling -> Gather the Orbs -> Inform Leoroxx! -> There Can Be Only One Response. Turn in the Ruuan Weald breadcrumb too; comments identify it as a missing final hand-in.\n\n6. HORDE - Reunion / ALLIANCE - The Gronn Threat: follow your faction's introduction to Rexxar/Baron Sablemane. Horde starts Garm Wolfbrother's Whispers on the Wind and Leoroxx's Reunion before Rexxar's tasks. Complete Sablemane's Churning Gulch poison, The Smallest Creatures (use the controlled marmot), A Boaring Time for Grulloc, It's a Trap!, Gorgrom's Altar and Prisoner of the Bladespire. Finish Showdown at the northern altar and return for the final report.\n\n7. BOTH - Ruuan Weald: start Evergrove's Culling the Wild and loot the Damaged Mask. Follow Mystery of the Mask -> Felsworn Gas Mask. WEAR the mask at Forge Camp: Anger to speak to the communicator, then finish Deceive Thy Enemy, You're Fired! and the Death's Door flare/cannon chain through The Hound-Master. For the cannon mission, collect the requested fel ammunition and use the provided control rather than your own attacks on the gate.\n\n8. Also finish Evergrove's Creating the Pendant / Whispers of the Raven God and Tree Warden Chawn's Wyrmcult investigation. Loot the note, follow Wyrmskull Watcher / Longtail, enter Blackwing Coven (32, 33.7), assemble the disguise from five costume scraps and talk to Kolphis Darkscale inside. Continue Maxnar Must Die! and return to Evergrove. Check the four applicable chapters; do not start an unrelated Ogri'la crystal grind to fill a removed criterion.",
        stepCount = 8,
        waypoints = {
