    [1194] = {
        achievementId = 1194,
        name = "Into the Nether",
        category = "Quests",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Into the Nether",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Finish the named zone's story chapters and their quest prerequisites; legacy combat alone does not complete them.\n\n1. Track all SIX Netherstorm chapters. First choose Aldor OR Scryers in Shattrath through A'dal, Khadgar's City of Light tour and the faction-choice quest; speak to your chosen leader afterwards. The choice opens necessary inn quests in Area 52 even though the rest of the zone is faction-neutral.\n\n2. For Protect Area 52!, work through the goblins' local defense chains from Area 52, including the crystal/rock-flayer and manaforge threats. For Building the X-52 Nether-Rocket, follow Rocket-Chief Fuselage's parts and testing quests, including the robot escort through the Ruins of Enkaat. Return with every requested component and complete the rocket's final test/report.\n\n3. For Socrethar, take your Aldor/Scryer contacts' Manaforge B'naar quests inside Area 52's inn. Follow the shutdown and intelligence chain through the later manaforges, collecting the overseers' crystals and protecting the shutdown consoles. Continue the leader/reporting quests until offered your faction's Socrethar finale; a single B'naar shutdown is not the entire chapter.\n\n4. Use the supplied teleportation/disguise quest item to reach Socrethar's Seat from the northwestern Legion teleporter. Complete the scripted confrontation and your faction's final report. Accept the quest BEFORE attacking Socrethar; killing a visible NPC out of sequence does not replace the story event.\n\n5. For The Violet Tower, go to Kirin'Var Village in the southeast. Follow the ghost investigators' chains through the village's book/relic and restless-spirit objectives, including the culminating Naberius quest. Follow the Vargoth investigation too: recover access to his tower, speak to his image and continue Capturing the Keystone.\n\n6. Enter The Botanica, the northern Tempest Keep dungeon, for Capturing the Keystone. Loot the Keystone from COMMANDER SARANNIS, the first boss, then return to Archmage Vargoth at the Violet Tower. It is not a Warp Splinter drop. Completing this part can also unblock the eco-dome Consortium follow-up Success!.\n\n7. The Consortium chapter needs FOUR endpoints. For Full Triangle, start Khayji's Area 52 crystal/Heap/Warp-Raider Nesaad chain, follow Gahruj at Midrealm Post to Haramad at the Stormspire, then finish both triangulation points and Full Triangle. Turn in the final crystal report, not just the first measurement.\n\n8. For Success!, finish Mehrdad's Diagnostic! / New Opportunities / Deal With the Saboteurs, then Ghabar's Diagnosis: Critical and Testing the Prototype. At Eco-Dome Farfield, complete Tashar's All Clear! and Success!, returning to Ghabar. If the final quest is absent, finish the Violet Tower / Botanica Keystone chain in steps 5-6.\n\n9. For Securing the Celestial Ridge, take Marid's A Not-So-Modest Proposal at the Protectorate Watch Post. Retrieve the surveying equipment from the cave, meet Tyri and the Shrouded Figure on the ridge, and finish Getting Down to Business / A Promising Start / Troublesome Distractions. Use Tyri's horn and defeat Veraku for Securing the Celestial Ridge. If Netherwing reputation makes Veraku friendly, the quest's combat can require setting that faction At War.\n\n10. For Nexus-King Salhadaar, follow Commander Ameer's Ethereum investigations, relay/essence collection, sabotage and Delivering the Message escort. Use the Ethereum Transponder around 56, 38 to summon the Image of Commander Ameer when needed; this temporary quest giver may have no obvious exclamation mark on the map. Activate Salhadaar's three power conduits before fighting and return for the final hand-in.\n\n11. For Destroying the All-Devouring, follow Professor Dabiri's Recipe for Destruction at the Protectorate Watch Post. Complete On Nethery Wings using the quest dragon/bombs, then join Captain Saeed. Follow the squad and speak to Saeed again at the staging point outside Manaforge Ultris to start Dimensius's encounter. Kill Dimensius and turn in; flying straight to the boss without the squad does not advance the event.\n\n12. Check all six chapters. If The Consortium remains incomplete, confirm ALL FOUR: Full Triangle, Success!, Securing the Celestial Ridge and Nexus-King Salhadaar. Finish Shattrath faction reports, Vargoth's tower hand-ins and temporary Image-of-Ameer quests before assuming the zone is out of quests.\n\n13. ONLY if you have already completed and turned in Dimensius the All-Devouring (10439), but its chapter still lacks credit: a July 2026 Retail commenter reports resolving that state by completing Lorewalking: The Protectorate (85027). Lorewalker Cho offers the ethereal story in Stormwind (64.2, 16.2), Orgrimmar (54.2, 56.6) or Dornogal (49.6, 31.6). This is a reported credit workaround, not a prerequisite for the ordinary Netherstorm route above.",
