        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Hero of Shattrath",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Reach Exalted with both opposing Shattrath factions on one character, including the long allegiance conversion.\n\n1. On ONE character, reach Exalted with the Aldor or Scryers first. Use that faction's quest lines and marks/signets plus Fel Armaments or Arcane Tomes. Before switching, buy and learn any reputation recipes or tabard you still want from the first faction.\n\n2. To change from Scryers to Aldor, farm Dreadfang Venom Sacs from the spiders west/south of Allerian Stronghold and along Netherweb Ridge in Terokkar Forest. Give stacks of 8 to Sha'nir in Shattrath's Lower City (64.5, 15.1), starting Strained Supplies and continuing More Venom Sacs.\n\n3. To change from Aldor to Scryers instead, farm Dampscale Basilisk Eyes from Terokkar's Dampscale basilisks. Give stacks of 8 to Arcanist Adyria in Lower City (54.7, 22.1), starting Voren'thal's Visions and continuing More Basilisk Eyes. Use only the route toward your NEW faction.\n\n4. Keep doing the conversion hand-in until the DESIRED faction is Neutral. Watch its name carefully: stopping because the faction you are leaving says Neutral is a mistake noted in 2026 comments. From the bottom of Hated, 1,344 sacs/eyes is the unbuffed baseline; applicable reputation bonuses reduce it.\n\n5. When conversion turn-ins stop at Neutral, visit Khadgar in the Terrace of Light and take the new faction's introduction if offered. Then use Marks of Kil'jaeden/Firewing Signets until Honored and Marks of Sargeras/Sunfury Signets or Fel Armaments/Arcane Tomes onward to Exalted.\n\n6. Reach Exalted with the second faction on that SAME character. The game remembers the first Exalted standing; both need not be Exalted simultaneously. Old comments describing a short-lived two-character shortcut or claiming the feat was permanently removed are superseded by later confirmations.",
        stepCount = 6,
        waypoints = {
            { mapID = 111, x = 0.308, y = 0.34600000000000003, step = 1, label = "Aldor Rise - first Exalted faction option" },
