    [1225] = {
        achievementId = 1225,
        name = "Outland Angler",
        category = "Professions",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Outland Angler",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Fish from each named Outland school; travel between zones and pool availability add to the effort.\n\n1. Learn Outland Fishing from Juno Dufrain at Cenarion Refuge (78.5, 63.0). Enable Find Fish if you have it. You must land the bobber IN each named school and successfully loot a catch; open water beside the school does not credit its criterion.\n\n2. In Zangarmarsh, fish a Sporefish School and a Brackish Mixed School. Search the lakes and shorelines near Cenarion Refuge and the pumping stations. School pins are search areas, not guaranteed active nodes.\n\n3. In Outland Nagrand, catch from a Bluefish School and a Mudfish School. Check Skysong Lake north of Garadar and Sunspring Lake west of Halaa, circling the shoreline for both names.\n\n4. In Terokkar Forest, fish a School of Darter in the river system between Tuurem, Allerian Stronghold and Firewing Point. If only Brackish Mixed Schools are present, empty them and revisit the river so new school types can spawn.\n\n5. Fly up to Lake Ere'Noru near Allerian Stronghold, Lake Jorune or Blackwind Lake in Skettis and catch from a HIGHLAND MIXED SCHOOL. These are elevated lakes, not the lowland rivers. This catch also gives a chance at Mr. Pinchy.\n\n6. Check all six names in the achievement before leaving. Grey weeds or other junk may fail to credit the school: reposition the bobber and keep fishing until the criterion updates.",
