    [1262] = {
        achievementId = 1262,
        name = "Loremaster of Outland",
        category = "Quests",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Loremaster of Outland",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Finish every required Outland zone-story achievement, including the longer branching chains.\n\n1. Enable Trivial Quests and track the SEVEN zone achievements. Modern Loremaster uses named story chapters, not the original fixed quest counts. Use one character's quest log to follow each chain coherently; faction variants use different hubs and final reports.\n\n2. Complete To Hellfire and Back: Honor Hold / Temple of Telhamat for Alliance, or Thrallmar / Spinebreaker / Falcon Watch for Horde. Both need the Razelcraz mine AND crashed-zeppelin goblin stories, plus Cenarion Post.\n\n3. Complete Mysteries of the Marsh in Zangarmarsh: faction towns, Cenarion Refuge's drain/Sporelok stories, Watcher Leesa'oh and Sporeggar. Finish the cross-zone report to Hellfire and any remaining escort rather than stopping at a reputation rank.\n\n4. Complete Terror of Terokkar: your stronghold, the Warden/Firewing investigation, Refugee Caravan, Skettis Offensive and Sha'tari Base Camp. The map and the child achievement's guide include the Shattrath reports and Haylen's easy-to-miss final chain.\n\n5. Complete Nagrand Slam in OUTLAND. Finish the Mastery hunts, Ring of Blood, Throne of the Elements, Consortium, Murkblood, Lantresor and town WANTED quests plus Altruis. Alliance also rescues Corki; Horde completes Birth of a Warchief, including its Auchenai Crypts quest.\n\n6. Complete On the Blade's Edge using your faction's four chapters. Finish Evergrove's Wyrmcult and Death's Door stories too. The old Ogri'la/Apexis-relic requirement is removed; do not grind its reputation for Loremaster.\n\n7. Complete Into the Nether in Netherstorm. Choose Aldor or Scryers in Shattrath for Socrethar, finish Vargoth's Botanica Keystone quest, and finish all FOUR Consortium endpoints. The child guide explains the temporary Image of Ameer and Saeed's Dimensius event.\n\n8. Complete Shadow of the Betrayer in OUTLAND Shadowmoon. Keep the quest items and follow the cross-zone routes to David Wayne and Altruis. Original Mechanar, Botanica, Arcatraz, Shadow Labyrinth, Steamvault, Shattered Halls and Auchenai Crypts can be needed across the different zone chains; accept the relevant quests before running them. Netherwing Exalted and old raid attunements are unnecessary.\n\n9. Open each incomplete child achievement and use its detailed numbered route to resolve the missing chapter. Finish outstanding reports before abandoning a chain. Ghostlands and Bloodmyst have separate quest achievements and are not additional requirements of this seven-zone meta.",
        stepCount = 9,
        waypoints = {
            { mapID = 100, x = 0.5660000000000001, y = 0.667, step = 2, label = "Hellfire - Honor Hold (Alliance)" },
