    [1271] = {
        achievementId = 1271,
        name = "To Hellfire and Back",
        category = "Quests",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "To Hellfire and Back",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Finish the named zone's story chapters and their quest prerequisites; legacy combat alone does not complete them.\n\n1. On a HORDE character, enable Trivial Quests and track the eight story chapters. Start Thrallmar's Nazgrel chain and report to Reaver's Fall. Follow Eradicate the Burning Legion, the gateway bombing missions and the Abyssal Shelf mission to finish Disrupt the Burning Legion. Take mission flights from the named quest NPC; do not look for the old dungeon attunements.\n\n2. For Cruel's Intentions, continue Nazgrel's northern forge-camp chain through Forge Camp: Mageddon, Cannons of Rage and Doorway to the Abyss. Accept Cruel's Intentions, kill Arazzius the Cruel at the Pools of Aggonar and return to Nazgrel.\n\n3. For The Mag'har, take The Assassin from Nazgrel. Find the Fel Orc Corpse west of the Pools (33.6, 43.5), complete A Strange Weapon / The Warchief's Mandate and use the supplied spirit item for A Spirit Guide. FOLLOW the wolf to Mag'har Post, then finish The Mag'har and its reporting follow-ups. This is also useful for opening Nagrand's Mag'har quests.\n\n4. For Spinebreaker Post and The Hand of Kargath, complete the apothecary chain beginning with Bonechewer Blood, following Zelana to Spinebreaker and Boiling Blood back to Antonivich. Continue A Burden of Souls -> The Demoniac Scryer -> Report to Nazgrel -> The Foot of the Citadel. Kill Gorax beneath the Citadel, plant the supplied challenge on his corpse, then kill and loot the summoned Hand of Kargath; turn in his head.\n\n5. At Falcon Watch, finish the blood-elf expedition's local investigations, including its arakkoa/Avruu and missing-ranger rescue chains. Check inside the tower as well as the ground-level camp for follow-ups. Turn in the final chapter quests rather than assuming the first set of local kills is enough.\n\n6. For Green, But Not Orcs, finish all four Razelcraz mine quests outside the mine northwest of Thrallmar: Outland Sucks!, How to Serve Goblins, Shizz Work and Beneath Thrallmar. ALSO complete both goblins' chains at Zeppelin Crash: Screed's salvage/voidwalkers and Legassi's eggs -> hellboar -> Smooth as Butter. The mine alone does not credit this chapter.\n\n7. At Cenarion Post, complete Demonic Contamination -> Testing the Antidote. Finish Colossal Menace, start the giants' Crimson Crystal Shard quest and continue The Earthbinder -> Natural Remedies. Use the quest item at the marked rune, finish the event and turn in. Check the eight story criteria; old numeric quest totals and removed key chains are unnecessary.",
