        source = "Outland Dungeonmaster",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete all component legacy dungeon or raid achievements, requiring several full instance routes.\n\n1. Normal or Heroic clears count; choosing Heroic also advances Outland Dungeon Hero. Complete all 16 original Burning Crusade dungeon achievements. Keys, reputation attunements and a prior Normal Magisters' Terrace clear are no longer required.\n\n2. Hellfire Peninsula: clear Hellfire Ramparts, The Blood Furnace and The Shattered Halls in Hellfire Citadel. On Heroic Ramparts, defeat both Omor and the Vazruden/Nazan encounter.\n\n3. Zangarmarsh: dive through the central pipe in Serpent Lake and clear Slave Pens, Underbog and Steamvault. In Steamvault, activate BOTH control panels after the first two bosses to unlock the last room.\n\n4. Terokkar Forest: visit all four Auchindoun entrances: Mana-Tombs north, Auchenai Crypts west, Sethekk Halls east and Shadow Labyrinth south. Anzu alone does not finish Sethekk Halls; continue to Ikiss.\n\n5. Netherstorm: fly to the three Tempest Keep satellite dungeons: Mechanar, Botanica and Arcatraz. The central Eye raid is separate. Mechanar's gatewatchers and Arcatraz's final prison event must be completed to reach their final bosses.\n\n6. Caverns of Time, Tanaris: complete Old Hillsbrad's Thrall escort through Epoch Hunter and all 18 rifts of Black Morass through Aeonus. The achievements call these The Escape From Durnholde and Opening of the Dark Portal.\n\n7. Take Shattrath's portal to original Isle of Quel'Danas and clear original Magisters' Terrace through Kael'thas. Check the meta's remaining child achievements before leaving; Midnight's newer instance does not replace this original clear.",
