        source = "Outland Raider",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete all component legacy dungeon or raid achievements, requiring several full instance routes.\n\n1. Track this meta and complete its eight original raid kill achievements. Karazhan, Hyjal and Sunwell count even though their entrances are on Azeroth. Original Zul'Aman was removed from the requirements; its later five-player remake is not needed.\n\n2. In Outland, clear Gruul's Lair in Blade's Edge Mountains and Magtheridon's Lair at ground level on the western side of Hellfire Citadel. Kill Gruul and Magtheridon, not only their opening council/channelers.\n\n3. In Zangarmarsh, swim through Coilfang Reservoir's central pipe and kill Lady Vashj in Serpentshrine Cavern. In Netherstorm, enter the CENTRAL Tempest Keep structure, The Eye, and kill Kael'thas.\n\n4. In Outland Shadowmoon Valley, clear original Black Temple through Illidan. Speak to Akama when needed to advance the summit event.\n\n5. In Deadwind Pass, enter original ground-level Karazhan, complete Opera and Chess, then kill Prince Malchezaar. Legion's Return to Karazhan dungeon is separate.\n\n6. Inside the Caverns of Time in Tanaris, enter Battle for Mount Hyjal. Complete Jaina's and Thrall's wave sequences and defeat Archimonde.\n\n7. Take Shattrath's portal to original Isle of Quel'Danas and clear Sunwell Plateau through Kil'jaeden. Check all eight child achievements; you need not earn them in a particular order or on one weekly lockout.",
