    [1311] = {
        achievementId = 1311,
        name = "Medium Rare",
        category = "Exploration",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Medium Rare",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Find and defeat one Outland rare; spawn availability and patrol routes can require searching.\n\n1. Kill ANY ONE of the twenty Outland rares below. You can stop after the first credited kill. Track the missing rare names before flying. Map pins mark reported SEARCH POINTS, not guaranteed stationary spawns. Sweep the land between matching pins and use /targetexact with the full rare name while nearby. These old rares have variable availability; neither a server restart nor War Mode guarantees a spawn.\n\n2. In Hellfire, search the burrower areas west/south of the Citadel for Fulgorge: look for unusually large moving dirt/rock eruptions and approach on the ground to make the worm emerge. Mekthorg the Wild visits orc camps around the Citadel and Zeth'Gor. Vorakem Doomspeaker appears in the northern/eastern demon camps; check each region instead of camping one point.\n\n3. In Zangarmarsh, search the broken villages in the northwest, center-south and far southeast for Bog Lurker. Check naga pump camps for Coilfang Emissary. Marticar patrols the west coast, northern marsh and northeast; follow the routes between pins rather than waiting at one endpoint.\n\n4. In Terokkar, search the whole Bone Wastes around Auchindoun for Crippler. Doomsayer Jurim walks roads around Shattrath, Cenarion Thicket, Tuurem and toward the east; city guards can kill him. Check Veil Reskk, Shienor, Skith and the southeastern arakkoa settlement for Okrek, including platforms above the ground.\n\n5. In Nagrand, look UNDERWATER in the major lakes for Goretooth, including Sunspring, Skysong and the southeastern lake. Voidhunter Yar patrols around Oshu'gun. Bro'Gaz the Clanless is not a criterion, so his kill does not replace either required rare.\n\n6. In Blade's Edge, check the long western Netherwing-dragon plateau for Hemathion. Morcrush travels the eastern and northeastern giant areas. Speaker Mar'grom appears among ogre camps in the southwest, west-central and north; search all three regions.\n\n7. In Netherstorm, check Manaforge Ara, Coruu and Duro for Chief Engineer Lorthander. Ever-Core the Punisher patrols B'naar, Ara and Ultris. Nuramoc FLIES along the southern edge, northern Duro ridge and Stormspire island's western side, so scan above ground level and between its route points.\n\n8. In OUTLAND Shadowmoon, Ambassador Jerrikar can visit Illidari Point, Eclipse Point, Coilskar Point, the Ruins of Baa'ri and the southern Black Temple area. Collidus the Warp-Watcher has central, northeastern and southeastern patrols. Kraator appears near Legion Hold, the Hand of Gul'dan, Eclipse Point, northern Coilskar and the area north of Warden's Cage. Search every missing rare's separate regions on later circuits.\n\n9. Confirm Medium Rare has credited after your kill. Buying one of the rare's tradable drops does not count as killing it.",
