l and north; search all three regions.\n\n7. In Netherstorm, check Manaforge Ara, Coruu and Duro for Chief Engineer Lorthander. Ever-Core the Punisher patrols B'naar, Ara and Ultris. Nuramoc FLIES along the southern edge, northern Duro ridge and Stormspire island's western side, so scan above ground level and between its route points.\n\n8. In OUTLAND Shadowmoon, Ambassador Jerrikar can visit Illidari Point, Eclipse Point, Coilskar Point, the Ruins of Baa'ri and the southern Black Temple area. Collidus the Warp-Watcher has central, northeastern and southeastern patrols. Kraator appears near Legion Hold, the Hand of Gul'dan, Eclipse Point, northern Coilskar and the area north of Warden's Cage. Search every missing rare's separate regions on later circuits.\n\n9. After each circuit, check off credited names and revisit only missing creatures. Progress is account-wide, but every required NAME must be killed; no fixed respawn schedule or single empty pin proves a rare is unavailable.",
