    },
    [1801] = {
        achievementId = 1801,
        name = "Captain Rumsey's Lager",
        category = "Professions",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Captain Rumsey's Lager",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Obtain the fishing-reward recipe and brew the drink; buying a Timewalking reward bag can provide extra chances.\n\n1. Search your Cooking recipe book for Captain Rumsey's Lager FIRST. Many commenters had already learned it and only needed to brew it. If learned, skip to step 3.\n\n2. Complete Old Man Barlo's fishing daily at Silmyr Lake in Terokkar (38.7, 12.8) or Marcia Chase's fishing daily in Northrend Dalaran (52.6, 65.6), then open their Bag of Fishing Treasures. The recipe can also appear in cooking daily reward bags from The Rokk or the Northrend cooks. Learn Recipe: Captain Rumsey's Lager when it drops.\n\n3. Buy 1 Skin of Dwarven Stout and 1 Flagon of Dwarven Mead. Kylene in Shattrath's World's End Tavern (73.5, 32.7) sells both, avoiding the old comments' removed city-vendor locations.\n\n4. At a cooking fire, brew the lager yourself. Learning the recipe alone, drinking a bought lager, or merely keeping the recipe scroll in your bags does not complete this craft-it objective.",
