        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Prepare three level-25 pets of the required family and defeat all five tamers with eligible teams.\n\n1. Prepare THREE level-25 Magic pets. Every slot must satisfy the family and level requirement, even if one pet never fights. A reported starting team is Enchanted Tiki Mask (1/1/2), Enchanted Pen (1/1/2) and Enchanted Torch (1/1/1). The numbers select the first/second ability in each of the three Journal ability slots; heal between battles.\n\n2. Defeat Nicki Tinytech in Hellfire Peninsula (64.4, 49.2). Her opponents are Mechanical. Keep your entire team in the required family; a pet's attack type can differ from its family.\n\n3. Defeat Ras'an beside Sporeggar in Zangarmarsh (17.2, 50.6). His opponents are Humanoid, Flying and Magic. Reorder your eligible team and change abilities before the fight to cover these matchups.\n\n4. Defeat Narrok in Nagrand, OUTLAND (61.0, 49.4). His opponents are Critter, Aquatic and Beast. Heal and revive before moving to the next trainer.\n\n5. Defeat Morulu the Elder in Shattrath's Lower City (59.0, 70.6). All three enemies are Aquatic crocolisks; check their queued attacks before spending a defensive cooldown.\n\n6. Defeat Bloodknight Antari in Shadowmoon Valley, OUTLAND (30.6, 41.8). His enemies are Magic, Elemental and Dragonkin. Antari replaced the old erroneous Gorma Asaan criterion. Check that all five trainer criteria have credited; daily availability can prevent immediately repeating an already completed tamer.\n\n7. Nicki's machines are the awkward matchup. Magic-family pets with ELEMENTAL attacks, including Enchanted Torch or Abyssius, keep the team eligible while exploiting that weakness.",
        stepCount = 7,
        waypoints = {
            { mapID = 100, x = 0.644, y = 0.49200000000000005, step = 2, label = "Nicki Tinytech - Mechanical opponents" },
            { mapID = 102, x = 0.172, y = 0.506, step = 3, label = "Ras'an - Humanoid, Flying, Magic" },
